      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Trigger </strong>The Assembled Council enters Duelist Form via Shifting Form.</p><p><strong>Requirements </strong>The Assembled Council is in Duelist Form.</p><hr /><p>The Assembled Council enters a dueling stance, with its weapon held high and ready to strike. The Assembled Council gains a +2 status bonus to AC. The Assembled Council gains access to the Fumble Fury and Not Your Line! reactions. </p><p> </p><p>While using Duelist Dance, the Assembled Council can use one reaction during every creature's turn, even if they do not have a reaction to spend.</p>"
